        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-3227/12 12 Inch Modern Square  Solid Brass Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n<p>\r\nVery modern designed 12\" glass shower door pulls made of 1\" square solid brass  by First Impressions, a leader manufacturer in door pulls.  Designed to enhance any setting where a modern, sharp, crisp look is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThese modern square shower handles are available in your choice of 10 beautiful and durable finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-MD-finish.jpg?v=1704354566\" width=\"160\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Modern Square Stainless Steel  Shower Pulls\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions  SD-3227/12 Modern  Shower Pulls\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 11 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 7 3/4\" C/C (distance between the 2 mounting holes)</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finishes: 10\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: These solid brass shower door pulls are hand crafted in the USA. Other lengths are available and the  Center to Center Mounting distance can be adjusted for your specific application.  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</b></a> with your requirements.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Packaged with 2 door pull handles and includes the hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold as a Pair (2 Pulls)</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "12 Inch Modern Square Solid Brass Shower Pulls, Pair, First Impressions SD-3227/12",
                "description": "Very modern designed 12 inch glass shower door pulls  made of 1 inch square solid brass by First Impressions, a leader manufacture in door pulls.  They requiring little maintenance, designed to enhance any setting where a modern, sharp, crisp look is desired. ",
